<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN arranges DM 250 mln loan for Kaucuk.</title>
<headline>ABN arranges DM 250 mln loan for Kaucuk.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO bank said on Friday it had arranged a medium-term loan of DM 250 million over seven years for the Czech petrochemical firm Kaucuk.</p>
<p>ABN AMRO, bookrunner and documentation agent, said the syndicated loan had been oversubscribed.  </p>
<p>ABN AMRO said Kaucuk needed the loan to reorganise its styrene and polystyrene units and the electricity plant. It also needed finances for its unit K-Petrol.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
